Output demo-list.gif

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Shell "bash"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms

Type "# Browse exercises with gymctl"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "./gymctl list --track docker-fundamentals"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "./gymctl list --difficulty beginner"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 500ms